---
// CAP Theorem Triangle & PACELC Latency Tradeoff Diagram Component
---

<figure class="cap-diagram" aria-labelledby="cap-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 840x380, spacious layout, large text, generous padding) -->
  <svg
    class="cap-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 840 380"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="cap-diagram-title cap-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="cap-diagram-title">CAP 定理權衡三角與 PACELC 延遲模型</title>
    <desc id="cap-diagram-desc">
      展示在物理分區 P 不可避免的前提下，系統面臨 CP (強一致) 與 AP (高可用)
      權衡；以及 PACELC 模型：分區時選 A 或 C，無分區時在 Latency 延遲與
      Consistency 一致性間取捨。
    </desc>

    <!-- Left Box: CAP Triangle & Network Reality (X: 20, Y: 20, Width: 385, Height: 335) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 20)">
      <rect width="385" height="335" rx="12" class="cap-diagram__card"></rect>
      <text class="cap-diagram__badge" x="24" y="30">01. CAP THEOREM</text>
      <text class="cap-diagram__title" x="24" y="56">CAP 物理分區約束三角</text>

      <!-- Triangle Visual (Vertices: (192, 126), (72, 226), (312, 226)) -->
      <polygon points="192,126 72,226 312,226" class="cap-diagram__tri-poly"
      ></polygon>

      <!-- Node C: Consistency -->
      <g transform="translate(192, 126)">
        <circle r="24" class="cap-diagram__circle cap-diagram__circle--blue"
        ></circle>
        <text
          class="cap-diagram__circle-text cap-diagram__circle-text--blue"
          y="7"
          text-anchor="middle">C</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__node-label" y="-34" text-anchor="middle"
          >Consistency (強一致)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Node A: Availability -->
      <g transform="translate(72, 226)">
        <circle r="24" class="cap-diagram__circle cap-diagram__circle--green"
        ></circle>
        <text
          class="cap-diagram__circle-text cap-diagram__circle-text--green"
          y="7"
          text-anchor="middle">A</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__node-label" y="44" text-anchor="middle"
          >Availability (高可用)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Node P: Partition Tolerance -->
      <g transform="translate(312, 226)">
        <circle r="24" class="cap-diagram__circle cap-diagram__circle--purple"
        ></circle>
        <text
          class="cap-diagram__circle-text cap-diagram__circle-text--purple"
          y="7"
          text-anchor="middle">P</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__node-label" y="44" text-anchor="middle"
          >Partition (分區容忍)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Reality Callout at bottom -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 286)">
        <rect width="345" height="34" rx="6" class="cap-diagram__alert-box"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="cap-diagram__alert-text"
          x="172"
          y="22"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          實體網路：P 為必選項 ➔ 實為 CP vs. AP 二選一！
        </text>
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Right Box: PACELC Extended Model (X: 435, Y: 20, Width: 385, Height: 335) -->
    <g transform="translate(435, 20)">
      <rect width="385" height="335" rx="12" class="cap-diagram__card"></rect>
      <text class="cap-diagram__badge" x="24" y="30">02. PACELC MODEL</text>
      <text class="cap-diagram__title" x="24" y="56"
        >PACELC 延遲與一致性取捨</text
      >

      <!-- If Partition (P) Card -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 78)">
        <rect
          width="345"
          height="110"
          rx="8"
          class="cap-diagram__subcard cap-diagram__subcard--red"></rect>
        <text class="cap-diagram__header cap-diagram__header--red" x="16" y="26"
          >若發生網路分區 (If Partition - P)：</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__desc" x="16" y="54"
          >• 系統必須在【可用性 A】與【強一致性 C】間抉擇</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__tag cap-diagram__tag--red" x="16" y="84"
          >CP (如 Spanner, etcd) vs. AP (如 DynamoDB)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Else (E) Card -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 204)">
        <rect
          width="345"
          height="110"
          rx="8"
          class="cap-diagram__subcard cap-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="cap-diagram__header cap-diagram__header--blue"
          x="16"
          y="26">若系統正常無分區 (Else - E)：</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__desc" x="16" y="54"
          >• 系統必須在【極低延遲 L】與【強一致性 C】間取捨</text
        >
        <text class="cap-diagram__tag cap-diagram__tag--blue" x="16" y="84"
          >EL (極低讀寫延遲) vs. EC (等待多副本同步)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile vertical layout -->
  <div class="cap-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="cap-mobile-card cap-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="cap-mobile-badge cap-mobile-badge--purple"
        >CAP THEOREM IN REALITY</span
      >
      <h4>網路分區 P 是客觀物理現實</h4>
      <p>
        實體網路的光纖損壞、交換機故障必然發生；因此架構師的真實決策不是「三選二」，而是在分區發生時選擇保證強一致（CP）或維持高可用（AP）。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-mobile-arrow">↓ 深入延遲代價評估</div>

    <div class="cap-mobile-card cap-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="cap-mobile-badge cap-mobile-badge--red"
        >PACELC: IF PARTITION (P)</span
      >
      <h4>分區發生時：A 與 C 的取捨</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>PC 模式</strong>：拒絕非多數派節點讀寫，防止髒讀（如
        etcd、ZooKeeper）。<br />
        <strong>PA 模式</strong>：允許分區孤島繼續回覆，容忍暫時不一致（如
        Cassandra）。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-mobile-arrow">↓ 系統平穩運行時</div>

    <div class="cap-mobile-card cap-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="cap-mobile-badge cap-mobile-badge--blue"
        >PACELC: ELSE (E)</span
      >
      <h4>平穩無分區時：Latency (L) vs. Consistency (C)</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>EL 模式</strong>：非同步複製，追求個位數毫秒極致低延遲。<br />
        <strong>EC 模式</strong>：強制多副本 Raft/Paxos 同步落盤，以延遲換取
        100% 強一致性。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="cap-diagram-caption">
    圖：分散式共識基石 —— CAP 定理物理分區約束三角與 PACELC 延遲代價模型
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cap-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .cap-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .cap-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Base Tokens */
  .cap-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .cap-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .cap-diagram__title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .cap-diagram__tri-poly {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .cap-diagram__circle {
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .cap-diagram__circle--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
    stroke: #3b82f6;
  }
  .cap-diagram__circle-text--blue {
    fill: #2563eb;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__circle--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__circle-text--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .cap-diagram__circle--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  .cap-diagram__circle-text--green {
    fill: #15803d;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__circle--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.2);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__circle-text--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .cap-diagram__circle--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  .cap-diagram__circle-text--purple {
    fill: #7c3aed;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__circle--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__circle-text--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .cap-diagram__node-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .cap-diagram__alert-box {
    fill: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.08);
    stroke: #f97316;
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__alert-box {
    fill: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.16);
    stroke: #fb923c;
  }

  .cap-diagram__alert-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #ea580c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__alert-text {
    fill: #fdba74;
  }

  .cap-diagram__subcard {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .cap-diagram__subcard--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.05);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__subcard--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .cap-diagram__header--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__header--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .cap-diagram__tag--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__tag--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .cap-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
    stroke: #3b82f6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__subcard--blue {
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .cap-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #2563eb;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__header--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .cap-diagram__tag--blue {
    fill: #2563eb;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-diagram__tag--blue {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .cap-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Mobile Breakpoint (≤ 48rem / 768px) */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .cap-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .cap-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .cap-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .cap-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
    }
    .cap-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    .cap-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04);
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-mobile-card--blue {
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
      border-color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .cap-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .cap-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .cap-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .cap-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #3b82f6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cap-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .cap-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .cap-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .cap-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
